WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.000
In Shortcuts, find the personal shortcut Record spending.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Tap the play button at the top right of the card.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.500
Enter the description and amount, for example Coffee $4.50.

4
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:14.500
Tap Done and check the saved amount.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:24.200
Open Kotori to review the pending entry.
